      "message": "ah, now i get what you\u0027re saying --- but i think we _still_ want to reject renderscript scripts in that case? if you\u0027re in this \"backwards\" case where you\u0027re dbt\u0027ing riscv64, that\u0027s because you\u0027re trying to test a riscv64 app, and we\u0027d be hurting you if we pretended renderscript was going to be okay on a _real_ riscv64 device.\n\n(probably worth a comment though!)",
